<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <h2>The Studio</h2>
  </div>
  <p>
    Good Loser Media is an independent documentary journalism studio I founded and
    run. It covers power, work and community through the people living it:
    farmworkers organizing for a union, punk bands building DIY venues,
    candidates running long-shot campaigns, and neighbors showing up for each
    other. Every story is released in English and Spanish, as a full film for
    the web and as cuts for vertical social. The name comes from people who
    keep showing up even when they know they might not win yet.
  </p>
</div>

