<h2>The Work</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Flying Z is a DIY Labor of Love</p>
  <p>
    A 19-minute documentary about Bill Zipperer, who built a music venue by
    hand on his farm outside Benton City, a town of about 4,000. Without
    outside funding, it now draws punk bands from across the state and gives
    local kids a place to start.
  </p>
</div>

