<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">One on One: John Duresky</p>
  <p>
    An hour-long sit-down with the only Democrat running in Washington's
    historically Republican 4th District. We covered his policies, where he breaks with the party establishment, and why he's running. The full
    interview is backed by short clips on single issues, built for social.
  </p>
</div>

