<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Movements on the Ground</p>
  <p>
    Field coverage of organizing across the Yakima Valley and Tri-Cities includes Sunnyside's May Day march, where farmworkers spoke out about mistreatment at a local mushroom farm, and Indigenous Joy Festival, where Yakama Nation members and Palestinian dancers met under the banner "From Turtle Island to Palestine."
  </p>
</div>

