<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">The Scene</p>
  <p>
    Coverage of the region's music community. At Crucial Times Fest, Spokane's hardcore scene raised more than $2,000 for local groups helping immigrants and refugees. A series of artist interviews with It's A Setup, A Quiet Life, Jumbotron, and Pannonica runs alongside it, with hand-drawn titles that match each band.
  </p>
</div>

